  {
   "id": 9000,
   "type": "MarkdownNote",
   "pos": [
    -1380,
    -230
   ],
   "size": [
    700,
    600
   ],
   "flags": {},
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# i2v-hunyuan15\nHunyuanVideo 1.5 (8.3B) image-to-video, 720p at 24 fps (native frame rate), no audio.\nStart frame only: there is no end-frame input in the official 1.5 nodes.\n\n**Inputs:** `in_start_image`, `in_prompt`, `in_negative_prompt`, `in_seconds` (frames = 4n+1 at 24 fps;\n121 frames = 5 s is the trained length), `in_size` 1280x720 (or 720x1280).\n\n**Steps:** 20 here (template default). The Hunyuan team's setting is 50 steps, cfg 6, shift 7 for 720p i2v:\nraise `in_steps` for finals. EasyCache (bypassed) speeds it up at some quality cost.\n\n**1080p:** the super-resolution pass (latent upsampler + 1080p SR distilled model, 8 steps) is bypassed.\nSelect those nodes and Ctrl+B to enable; output goes to `_1080p`."
   ],
   "title": "i2v-hunyuan15: how to use"
  }
